WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.562
Welcome to the Industry Team Notetaker orientation.

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:06.275
Preserve how Industry Team reached its decisions:

00:00:06.275 --> 00:00:10.000
the dynamics, alliances, turning points, observations,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.287
and sequence behind the formal record.

00:00:12.287 --> 00:00:15.762
Your walkthrough follows the evidence behind the formal decision.

00:00:15.762 --> 00:00:20.100
Capture observable moments first, then record dynamics and alliances

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.488
, compare them with the team artifact, and use

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:25.587
the timeline to test whether the sequence is coherent.

00:00:25.587 --> 00:00:29.775
Preserve your own seat’s perspective without overwriting another observer

00:00:29.775 --> 00:00:29.925
.
